   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Nordic muted: median ~99, the least saturated of the set (0.22), cool-grey shadows (39,45,49), cool highlights (201,204,212), aqua+blue 54%, muted sky (sat 0.24) and foliage (0.31). Best for: Minimal and abstract landscapes, snow, ice, grey days, aerial patterns, quiet fine-art frames, muted editorial pre-weddings. Desaturated - not for colourful decor.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
